  "story": {
    "enabled": true,
    "heading": "The Story",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Son Lux began as the solo project of composer Ryan Lott in 2008, expanding in 2014 into a trio with guitarist Rafiq Bhatia and drummer Ian Chang. Their catalog — Lanterns (2013), Bones (2015), Brighter Wounds (2018) and the triple album Tomorrows (2020-2021) — balances raw emotional intimacy against meticulous electronic construction.",
      "The trio scored Everything Everywhere All at Once (2022), earning an Academy Award nomination for Best Original Score, with a companion album featuring collaborations with Mitski, David Byrne, Randy Newman and Moses Sumney. They went on to score Marvel's Thunderbolts* (2025)."
    ]
  },
